@startuml SEQ_04_MELIHAT_REKAP_KEUANGAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-04: Melihat Rekap Keuangan

actor       "Admin / Kadep"            as Viewer
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "RekapKeuanganController"  as Controller
entity      "RiwayatKeuangan Model"    as Model

== Lihat Rekap ==

Viewer  -> Browser     : Buka menu rekap

Browser -> Controller  : GET /rekap-keuangan

Controller -> Model    : Query rekap bulanan
Model --> Controller   : Data rekap
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman
Browser --> Viewer     : Tampil rekap & tren

@enduml